\doxysubsection{Detailed Description}
Node that handles random movements to map the environment. 

Subscribes to the /scan topic to read obstacle distances and publishes commands on the /cmd\+\_\+vel topic to guide the robot while avoiding collisions using a simple heuristic approach. 

